  "description": "The meme is designed for individuals who identify as or are familiar with the experiences of military spouses, particularly those over the age of 30. It targets this community by using a stereotype that portrays them as overlooked, unappreciated, or stuck in repetitive, unfulfilling situations, which may resonate with or provoke reflection among members of this group.",
